unmodified executable that diagram-render runs as its own process; none is linked
into diagram-render. Their licences and notices are in licenses/, as their projects
ship them.

merman-cli 0.9.3 (Mermaid)
  Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0; the executable contains code under MPL-2.0 (such as
  cssparser) and EPL-2.0 (ELK).
  Notices: licenses/merman/
  Source: https://github.com/Latias94/merman/tree/v0.9.3
  Commit: 3b915f69c02d55b873d252cf6c8a6048e7f3427d
  Windows and macOS archives hold the project's own release. Linux archives hold its
  unmodified crate merman-cli 0.9.3 built as a static executable by
  scripts/fetch-engines.sh.

