BUNDLED FONTS

fonts/ holds the Liberation 2.1.5 fonts (OFL-1.1) and, in fonts/excalidraw/, the fonts
of @excalidraw/excalidraw 0.18.1: Excalifont, Virgil, Cascadia Code, Nunito and Lilita
One (OFL-1.1) and Comic Shanns (MIT). All are unmodified; their licences are in
licenses/fonts/.

